From 8a9944a71baf25fa79bb559886e18a2817d894f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arnab Sadhukhan <arnab@Arnabs-Mac-Mini.local>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 20:58:01 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 003/140] feat(jellyfin): dynamic per-library latest sections
 and show series grouping

- Fetch latest media per library with GroupItems=true instead of global flat list

- Display dynamic 'Latest <Library>' rows on home screen with direct navigation

- Resolve TV episodes into full series metadata, posters, and season counts

- Deduplicate items in 'Top Picks For You' and Hero sections

- Open series detail screen when clicking show cards and play next unplayed on long press
